"P3233642646" "Breaking Bows"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2518823173" "Longbow files"
// DetailString :
"P3029279069" "These files, taken from a Longbow listening post, catalogue the organization's findings during its abortive reconnaissance of Cap au Diable. Several of the findings could be worth money to the right buyer, and you file those away for later. But one file demands immediate action. It seems Longbow has learned of a trip Olivia Darque intends to make to Paragon City to curry favor with the Council. The file details Longbow's plans to apprehend the Arachnos sorceress."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DarqueSeal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3701414641" "Darque's ring"
// DetailString :
"P3651001644" "When you rescued Olivia Darque, she gave you a large ring bearing a strange sigil on its crown. It should be valuable as you try to move up in the world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P954585167" "Breaking Bows"
// DetailString :
"P2634758713" "You first learned of Longbow's incursion into the Rogue Isles from Peter Themari. He objected to the arrival of the hero organization, not just because it impacted his business efforts, but also because he hates to see anyone doing good. You were dispatched to apprehend a Longbow agent who was working with the Luddites to set up a Longbow base on Cap au Diable. You quickly returned with the ill-fated Agent Albrecht in tow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1918786565" "You first learned of Longbow's incursion into the Rogue Isles from Peter Themari. He objected to the arrival of the hero organization, not just because it impacted his business efforts, but also because he hates to see anyone doing good. You were dispatched to apprehend a Longbow agent who was working with the Luddites to set up a Longbow base on Cap au Diable. You quickly returned with the ill-fated Agent Albrecht in tow. <br><br>Under Themari's ruthless questioning, Agent Albrecht gave up the location of a Longbow listening base that had been established on Cap au Diable some months previous. You went there and disassembled it, knocking the stuffing out of the unprepared Longbow agents inside. You also stole their files, which included a plan to ambush Olivia Darque during a trip she planned to make to Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL2.5_CaD_Themari_MiniArc1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P508276196" "Olivia Darque's ring"
// tDetailString :
"P1932805377" "This ring, given to you by Olivia Darque, is more than just a way to open doors throughout Cap au Diable. It's also a reminder of an escapade you like to call: <br><br>Breaking Bows <br><br>You first learned of Longbow's incursion into the Rogue Isles from Peter Themari. He objected to the arrival of the hero organization, not just because it impacted his business efforts, but also because he hates to see anyone doing good. You were dispatched to apprehend a Longbow agent who was working with the Luddites to set up a Longbow base on Cap au Diable. You quickly returned with the ill-fated Agent Albrecht in tow. <br><br>Under Themari's ruthless questioning, Agent Albrecht gave up the location of a Longbow listening base that had been established on Cap au Diable some months previous. You went there and disassembled it, knocking the stuffing out of the unprepared Longbow agents inside. You also stole their files, which included a plan to ambush Olivia Darque during a trip she planned to make to Paragon City. <br><br>Helping anyone rubbed Themari the wrong way, but letting Longbow make a coup rubbed worse, so he sent you to Paragon City to ambush the ambushers. You rescued Olivia Darque, securing a name for yourself in the Rogue Isles and giving those Longbow do-gooders a few bruises to remember you by."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL2.5_CaD_Themari_MiniArc1_B 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// tDetailString :
"P732095501" "This ring, given to you by Olivia Darque before she was recaptured by Longbow, is a reminder of one of your narrowest escapes: <br><br>Breaking Bows <br><br>You first learned of Longbow's incursion into the Rogue Isles from Peter Themari. He objected to the arrival of the hero organization, not just because it impacted his business efforts, but also because he hates to see anyone doing good. You were dispatched to apprehend a Longbow agent who was working with the Luddites to set up a Longbow base on Cap au Diable. You quickly returned with the ill-fated Agent Albrecht in tow. <br><br>Under Themari's ruthless questioning, Agent Albrecht gave up the location of a Longbow listening base that had been established on Cap au Diable some months previous. You went there and disassembled it, knocking the stuffing out of the unprepared Longbow agents inside. You also stole their files, which included a plan to ambush Olivia Darque during a trip she planned to make to Paragon City. <br><br>Helping anyone rubbed Themari the wrong way, but letting Longbow make a coup rubbed worse, so he sent you to Paragon City to ambush the ambushers. You tried to rescue Olivia Darque, but Longbow was ready for you, and Darque was recaptured. Your reputation in Cap au Diable has taken a bit of a hit, and neither Darque, not her employer Marshall Leon Brass, is the forgiving sort. You had better watch your back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2756957830" "Have you heard of the rabble of pusillanimous vigilantes who call themselves Longbow? They make me sick. Scrupulous, sermonizing do-gooders. If they have their way, they'll turn my lovely Cap au Diable into a field of pink and yellow daisies, where happy kittens frolic and play. Disgusting! <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to put a stop to Longbow's incursion into the Rogue Isles.</A> According to my sources, a Longbow representative is meeting with the Luddites to discuss setting up a secret base here. Kidnap that representative and smack around a few of the Luddites for good measure. Should be easy, and fun."
// AcceptString :
"P164099883" "Put a stop to Longbow's incursion"
// SendOffString :
"P2900025137" "Longbow is a huge hero organization funded out of Paragon City. Get rid of them, and Arachnos will make it worth your while."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2355241084" "Defeat Longbow agent & his team"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P965023307" "I want that Longbow agent, {VillainName}. Get him for me, or we're through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3797613222" "The Luddites' poor hovel is lit with torches and candles rather than electrical fixtures. Pathetic."

