"P3099057447" "Mr. Albrecht and I have had a most pleasant conversation. According to him, Longbow has already established a listening post here on Cap. He was even kind enough to provide the coordinates. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to head over there and get rid of every single Longbow agent in the place.</A> See if you can find out what they've learned, too. That information will be valuable to Arachnos."
// AcceptString :
"P231790352" "Get rid of every Longbow agent in the listening post"
