// Dialog :
"P4161090022" "According to these files you recovered, Olivia Darque is in for a surprise when she docks at Paragon City. Now, ordinarily I'd be happy to let the fool rot in the Ziggurat. But I won't have Longbow thinking they've got the better of the Rogue Isles. So we're going to save Ms. Darque, {VillainName}. Yes, much as it pains me, we're going to save someone."
// RandomFameString :
"P1410801573" "{VillainName} uncovered a Longbow listening base and shut it down!"

