// Dialog :
"P129919508" "Darque is safe. Good. Longbow is beaten. Better. You've helped me keep Cap au Diable the free place it's meant to be, where people like you and I can cut loose and enjoy ourselves. Don't expect me to say thank you. But I must admit, I'm mighty glad."
// RandomFameString :
"P1117025634" "Olivia Darque says {VillainName}'s moving up in the world!"

