// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3879061604" "Well, that was a wasted effort, to be sure. Darque remains in Longbow's hands, and both of our reputations have taken a hit. You'll have to do better than this if you want to keep working with me, {VillainName}. I don't associate with those Arachnos marks for death."
// RandomFameString :
"P4183522751" "{VillainName} is in big trouble with Marshall Brass!"

